<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the main headlines from Radio Latvia's early afternoon news report. Reuters has not verfied these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The defence budget for 1998 should be increased by eight million lats, the head of parliament's defence commission, Karlis Druva, said.</p>
<p>- The state investment programme for 1998 is planned at 43 million lats, Finance Minister Roberts Zile said. The figure must still be approved by the cabinet.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
